    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, and halve tomatoes lengthwise. Place in a medium bowl."
    },
    {
      "text": "Wash, dry, trim, and medium dice cucumber. Add to the bowl with the tomatoes and stir to combine."
    },
    {
      "text": "To serve, divide cottage cheese, tomato, and cucumber between bowls. Drizzle with oil, then sprinkle with sesame seeds, salt, and pepper. Enjoy!"
